{"n": 694, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "694.webp", "text": "35-2\n\nInstallation:\n\nDistance (B)* must be reached.\n\nif distance (B)* cannot be reached with\nthe described adjusting procedures,\nturn the eccentric bolt 180°.\n\nImportant!\n\nintermediate positioning of the eccen-\ntric bolt:Is not approved!\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nInstallation:\nCars with over-center spring — check\nthe installed position.\n\nUnscrew master cylinder on the pedal\nconsole.\n\n3035018\n\nUnscrew bolts.\n\nInstallation:\nTightening torque*.\n\nUnscrew console on the engine com\npartment wall.\n\nInstallation:\nTightening torque*.\n\nInstallation:\n\nAdjust brake pedal height on brake\nlinkage (1) (see brake pedal Jayout\ndrawing).\n\nTightening torque*.\n\nInstallation:\nAdjust stop light -switch.\n\nB=5 to 6 mm (0.197 to 0.236\").\n\nStop Light Switch Since 1987 Models:\nSee Group 61 for adjusting as well as\nremoving and installing procedures.\n\nCheck function of stop lights.\n\n* See Specifications", "words": [["35-2", 0.4585, 0.0199, 0.5096, 0.0438], ["Installation:", 0.273, 0.0729, 0.3298, 0.0849], ["Distance", 0.272, 0.0895, 0.3191, 0.1021], ["(B)*", 0.3227, 0.0902, 0.3419, 0.1041], ["must", 0.3455, 0.0908, 0.3723, 0.1021], ["be", 0.3759, 0.0902, 0.3886, 0.1021], ["reached.", 0.3926, 0.0902, 0.4377, 0.1021], ["if", 0.272, 0.1061, 0.2786, 0.1174], ["distance", 0.2827, 0.1061, 0.3278, 0.1187], ["(B)*", 0.3318, 0.1061, 0.3511, 0.1207], ["cannot", 0.3546, 0.1074, 0.3911, 0.1207], ["be", 0.3951, 0.1068, 0.4078, 0.1187], ["reached", 0.4119, 0.1074, 0.4534, 0.1187], ["with", 0.4574, 0.1074, 0.4782, 0.1187], ["the", 0.272, 0.1227, 0.2888, 0.134], ["described", 0.2918, 0.1227, 0.3445, 0.1346], ["adjusting", 0.3485, 0.1233, 0.3982, 0.1379], ["procedures,", 0.4017, 0.1233, 0.465, 0.1379], ["turn", 0.272, 0.1399, 0.2933, 0.1512], ["the", 0.2974, 0.1393, 0.3141, 0.1512], ["eccentric", 0.3176, 0.1399, 0.3668, 0.1519], ["bolt", 0.3708, 0.1393, 0.3906, 0.1519], ["180°.", 0.3946, 0.1393, 0.4